[
  {
    "id": 1011001020010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00009",
    "bgm": "015",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　どうしたんだ、樹里？\r\n何か気になることでもあるのか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……逆に、アンタは気になんね－のかよ\r\nアタシがこの場にいることについてさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この場にって……別に、気にならないけどな\r\n今日は宣材写真を撮る日だって、説明してなかったか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そういうことじゃね－っての\r\nアレを見ても、アンタは何も思わね－のか？",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アレって……\r\nああ、他のアイドルの撮影を見ていたんだな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、どうしてそんなに気にしてるんだ？\r\n宣材写真は、普段通りの姿を見せればいいんだぞ？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はぁ？　普段通りって……\r\nアンタ、何言ってんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "他のアイドルたちの笑顔が見えてんのか？\r\n可愛いポ－ズとって、にっこり笑って……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あんな姿、アタシにできると思うか？\r\n普段通りのアタシの中に、あんな笑顔はねぇだろーが",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そうか……樹里は周りのアイドルを見て\r\n自分が同じことをできるか気にしていたんだな）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（それなら、俺が樹里にかけるべき言葉は……）",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "だったら\r\n笑わないのはどうだ？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "樹里は\r\n笑顔も可愛いと思うぞ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "格好いい\r\n決めポ－ズを撮ろう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020070,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はぁ？\r\n笑わないって……それじゃ宣材にならねぇだろ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことはないさ\r\n宣材写真だからって、無理に笑顔を作る必要はないんだ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里がどんな女の子なのか紹介するためのものなんだから\r\n普段の樹里らしさが出る写真を撮ればいいんだよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ふぅん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……アンタがそれでいいって言うんなら\r\nアタシもその方が楽だし、そうするけどよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "けど、それで本当に大丈夫なのか？\r\nアイドルってもっと、笑顔を振りまくもんじゃね－の？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこはアイドルによるんじゃないか\r\n笑顔の可愛さが魅力のアイドルもいるだろうし－－",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里みたいに、ク－ルな表情が魅力的なアイドルを\r\n好きになってくれるお客さんもたくさんいるはずだよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はぁっ……！？　な、なんだよアンタ\r\n魅力がどうとか、言ってて恥ずかしくねぇのか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　まぁな。プロデュ－サ－として\r\n自分が受け持ったアイドルの魅力を考えるのは当然だろ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そうかよ……まぁなんでもいいけどさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そういうことなら、アタシは好きにやらせてもらうから\r\n後で文句言うんじゃね－ぞ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（お？　この樹里の表情、さっきまでよりずっと……）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それじゃ、行ってくるぜプロデュ－サ－",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うん。今の樹里の雰囲気なら\r\n魅力的な宣材写真が撮れること、間違いなしだな……！）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "juri"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020150,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ばっ、ばかやろ－！\r\nふざけたこと言ってんじゃね－ぞ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシの笑顔……可愛いって……\r\nそ、そんなわけ、あるかよ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020170",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020180,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "つ、つ－かよく考えたらテメ－\r\nアタシの笑顔なんか見たことね－だろ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、確かにそうだな\r\n実際には見たことがないよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ほ、ほらみろ！\r\nやっぱりテキトー言っただけじゃねぇか",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020200,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ったく……ふざけやがって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、見なくたって分かる\r\n普段から樹里は魅力的だし、笑ったら絶対に可愛い",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020210,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ななな……こ、このっ！\r\n調子のいいことばっかり言ってんじゃねえよ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなにカリカリするなよ。俺は思ったことを言っただけだ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020220,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……こ、コイツ",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020230,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……なぁ、テキト－言ったわけじゃね－んだよな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "テキト－？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020240,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……はぁ。もういいよ\r\n笑顔で写真、撮ってくればい－んだろ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里……！\r\nけど、いいのか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020250,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "まぁな。……ガラじゃねぇけど\r\nアイドルやるって決めたわけだしな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020260,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "一度決めた以上はやってやるよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、その意気だ！\r\nいい笑顔を期待してるぞ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020270,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "い、いちいちうるせ－んだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020270"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "juri"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020280,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "格好いい？\r\n……可愛いじゃなくてか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里の場合は、可愛いより\r\n格好いいポ－ズの方が似合うと思うんだ。どうだ？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020290,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ま、そうだな\r\nアタシもその方が、自分に向いてると思うけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020300,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "でも、他のアイドルたちは笑顔で撮ってるだろ\r\n格好いいなんて、アイドルらしくね－んじゃねぇの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020300",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことはないさ\r\n樹里は樹里らしい形でアイドルをやっていけばいいんだよ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "可愛いアイドルは抵抗あるかもしれないけど\r\n格好いいアイドルなら、目指していけるんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020310,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "格好いいアイドル……か\r\nアイドルにも色んな方向性があるんだな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020320,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……よし。そろそろアタシの出番だし\r\n行ってくるよ、プロデュ－サ－",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、どういう写真を撮るのか\r\n考えはまとまったのか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020330,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ん？……ま－な",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020340,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "どのくらいできるかはわかんねぇけど\r\n今のアタシにできる、一番格好いいポ－ズで決めてくるよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100102/1011001020340"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001020350,
